  "description": "The three audit events contract-v0.3 adds (C6 decision 4): session.control — on every control-token move, reason attach, detach, handoff, owner, takeover or release, with from and to in the control-holder shape (null for escrow), so who could type when is on the record (5.53); session.kick — the owner or a session.terminate holder removed one attached client, naming that client and its principal; session.stale_choice — the holder answered the stale-grid prompt, with choice wiggle, ctrl_l, continue or fresh_session, cause gap or grid_lost, client_id the answering client, and gap_seq present exactly when cause is gap (a oneOf + const on cause, graded here). One spelling ctrl_l/fresh_session everywhere. user is the principal who acted: the departing holder for detach, the chooser for session.stale_choice. An action outside the vocabulary is refused.",
